# ClaimFlow Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# AI-Powered Fraud Screening & Claims Decisioning
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ClaimFlow supports AI-driven non-deterministic fraud evaluation with an
# automatic deterministic rule-based fallback (FR-01 to FR-06).
#
# To enable AI-powered evaluation:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env':
#      Copy-Item .env.example .env
# 2. Add your API key below (Gemini, OpenAI, or Anthropic):
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Option 1: Google Gemini (Recommended)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash


